         "sealed) and must name only the product file(s) -- you may edit the harness now, "
         "but the line must read e.g. `Only edit `" + (", ".join(f for f in _scope
                                                                if f not in _in_scope_harness)
                                                      or "TARGET")
         + "`; do not edit `verify.sh`, the test fixture, `check_literals.py` or `TASK.md`.`")
